lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Strategy:</strong> Navigate the environment carefully with stealth-based mechanics, using the shadows and your wits to avoid the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying Unpredictability:</strong> Nothing is certain, enemies lurk where you least expect, keeping you on edge with every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Inspiration:</strong> The setting and events of Jonah draw from chilling real-world myths and psychological horror, delivering a truly disturbing experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/ba7c179a5522d258be9837461e41fd6f.webp?t=1787073779\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.poster.avif?t=1787073779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.webm?t=1787073779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921360/extras/2244b8be8fc658c6db01a7552d6bf7c4.mp4?t=1787073779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is full of dark rooms and corridors that must be explored for the story to progresses. To gain access to the various rooms, you must first find the keys that fit the specific doors.  </p>", "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror game where a young boy is trapped in a haunted, decaying mansion. Run, hide, and outsmart vengeful spirits as you uncover dark, twisted secrets. Can you survive the nightmare that waits in every shadow?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>,